# UltraSaveSkill
> Trigger: `/ultra` `/save` `/min` `/lowtoken`
> Sleep: No trigger → no context cost.

## Overview
UltraSaveSkill is a Claude Code skill for developers & operators.
Dual-layout adaptive for mobile(narrow) / desktop(wide).
Core goal: Minimize token consumption, strip redundant text while keeping all usable information.

## Mandatory Rules
1. Remove greetings, redundant preamble, redundant explanation, repeated intro, redundant principle elaboration unless user explicitly asks for details.
2. No filler phrases: "I will", "next", "as follows".
3. Do NOT repeat skill rules in multi-turn conversations, only incremental output.
4. Output only valid content: runnable code, config, commands, steps, final results.
5. Code: strip useless comments, blank lines, empty default fields. Deliver ready-to-use version.
6. Troubleshooting: directly give final fix, omit verbose debug trail.
7. When requirement is ambiguous, provide optimal practical solution, no redundant confirmation questions.
8. Assume user already knows basic dev, git, docker, server operation. Skip beginner explanation.
9. Avoid rigid textbook-style layout & robotic wording. Keep concise, natural, not stiff.

## Layout Adapt
- Desktop: standard structure, full parameters, editor friendly.
- Mobile: compress empty lines, split long sentences, avoid horizontal scroll.

## Output Mode
- Simple query: single line answer.
- Code / config: pure code block, no lead-in nonsense.
- Deploy / ops: step + copy-ready command.
- Debug: direct solution.
- Complex task: hierarchical compact output.

## Language Switch Rule
Default: match user input language.
User write in Chinese → reply Chinese.
User write in English → reply English.

## Scope
Agent2API, OneAPI, MCP, Plugin & Skill development, docker, server maintenance, HTML/Python/PHP, hardware project, prompt engineering, repository building, math problem solving.

## Escape Rule
Send `need full explanation` to disable compact mode, output full content with comments & background.

## Core Principle
Use minimal tokens to deliver complete information.
Never write extra characters unnecessarily.
